@startuml
' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/Billing.cs SHA256 23d39e4ae022f1dc7fbbc055a423e32487b9664be8a1ef9d688c02322a621ab9
' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/QuoteGate.cs SHA256 48a0921754dbe63d5a0ef36be88869aa94809e98ad6d7664cb49c52d4450b498
' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/BillingPostgres/PostgresBillingQuoteStore.cs SHA256 079bcdcadde8478023dfcd185b107ec879f3a35ff7be1daf954644098b3f1841
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Monorepo — billing admission and credit debit
start
if (Billing bypass configured?) then (yes)
 :Allow with no quote;
 stop
endif
if (No quote ID?) then (yes)
 if (Tenant nonblank and known flat nonmetered service?) then (yes)
  :Attempt one-unit plan credit debit;
  if (Debit succeeded?) then (yes)
   :Persist zero-price approved_credit quote expiring in five minutes;
   :Allow with credit quote;
   stop
  endif
 endif
 :Deny quote_not_found;
 stop
endif
:Read quote; require exact tenant, case-insensitive service match,
unexpired quote and consumed=false;
if (Status approved or approved_credit?) then (yes)
 :Allow existing quote;
 stop
endif
:Attempt plan debit for all quoted units;
if (Debit succeeded?) then (yes)
 :Update quote approved_credit and price zero; allow;
elseif (Awaiting manual approval?) then (yes)
 :Deny payment_pending;
elseif (Stripe session exists?) then (yes)
 :Ask gateway whether session paid;
 if (Paid?) then (yes)
  :Update quote approved; allow;
 else (no)
  :Deny payment_pending;
 endif
else (no)
 :Deny payment_pending;
endif
stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Gate checks and plan debit do not reserve a quote in the transaction that
executes an operation. Debit can precede a failed quote write or later operation failure.
Quote updates are unconditional upserts; concurrent admission of the same unconsumed
approved quote is not excluded here. A billing gate is not a native resource grant,
cognition completion or successful effect receipt.
end footer

@enduml
